WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:06.350
Are you one of 5 in 10 Caucasians that suffers
from an embarrassing and debilitating genetic

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.560
affliction?

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:11.110
Can you not leave the house without hitting
or raping a woman?

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.960
Unable to resist the urge to belittle, shame
and sexually harass your female colleagues

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.960
at work?

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.100
Did you spend your childhood beating the shit
out of your friends at barbeques?

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.640
Do you still spend your social gatherings
revealing your spectacular abs and whipping

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.520
out your member to compare?

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:37.260
Then I am afraid, what you feared is true,
you suffer from a horrific disease, “maleness”.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.030
Don’t worry my disgusting, hairy friend,
there is a cure.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:47.850
“Anti Man”, proven to reduce your testosterone
and eradicate your masculinity within 30 days,

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:48.850
or your money back.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.719
Now with added soya!

00:00:50.719 --> 00:00:56.800
This is the message that a growing number
of gender activists and corporations that

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.930
wish to adopt a virtuous facade, most recently
Gillette, would have us believe.

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:04.479
But what’s the reality here?

00:01:04.479 --> 00:01:09.880
Based on social norms that have been developed
over thousands of years, underpinned by biology

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:18.240
and using empirical evidence I seek to rationalise
masculinity and answer an important question,

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:22.530
is being masculine bad for society?

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:27.299
A good start would be finding out what is
masculinity anyway?

00:01:27.299 --> 00:01:31.279
It is entirely distinct from an individual’s
biological sex.

00:01:31.279 --> 00:01:36.740
Sure masculine traits stem from a person’s
biological sex, but if we’re getting technical

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:43.759
then masculinity itself is a social construct
that describes a set of traits innately present

00:01:43.759 --> 00:01:45.280
in most men.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:50.859
The same traits, however, can often be found
in women, not always, and often to lesser

00:01:50.859 --> 00:01:52.429
extremes.

00:01:52.429 --> 00:01:56.599
The traits of masculinity can also differ
slightly between world cultures, but the core

00:01:56.599 --> 00:02:00.749
traits that define a masculine man are universally
consistent.

00:02:00.749 --> 00:02:03.229
What are those traits?

00:02:03.229 --> 00:02:09.860
Stoicism, resilience, strength, courage, independence
and assertiveness.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:16.230
Before judging men for being too assertive,
occasionally resorting to violence or too

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.209
stoic for not displaying emotion.

00:02:19.209 --> 00:02:24.550
It’s important to understand where these
traits actually come from.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:28.260
The traits themselves are not social constructs.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:33.969
Men don’t become masculine just because
we tell them that “crying is for girls”

00:02:33.969 --> 00:02:35.799
and “man up”.

00:02:35.799 --> 00:02:41.830
Masculinity in men may be enhanced or even
enforced in certain cultures by social pressures

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:50.280
but make no mistake, masculine traits originate
from our biology, constructed over a period

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:53.349
of 200,000 years.

00:02:53.349 --> 00:02:58.499
Long ago nature’s doctrine of survival of
the fittest decided the most efficient way

00:02:58.499 --> 00:03:03.660
to perpetuate a species through reproduction
and ensure its longevity is by dividing each

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.870
species into two sexes.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.749
This division is seen across the entire animal
kingdom.

00:03:10.749 --> 00:03:17.209
What can also be observed in all animal species
and humans are the different roles inherent

00:03:17.209 --> 00:03:19.549
within each sex.

00:03:19.549 --> 00:03:25.069
With the exception of the male pregnancy witnessed
in the Syngnathidae family of fish, the young

00:03:25.069 --> 00:03:29.069
of all species are incubated by the female
sex.

00:03:29.069 --> 00:03:35.209
It, therefore, makes sense, logistically,
that females evolved to have behavioural and

00:03:35.209 --> 00:03:41.019
physiological traits that are conducive to
the healthy development and loving nurture

00:03:41.019 --> 00:03:42.170
of their young.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:47.420
Empathy, emotional awareness, patience and
tenderness.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:53.379
Obviously, it was also vital that females
never put themselves or their young in a situation

00:03:53.379 --> 00:04:00.439
of danger, so evolution naturally put that
onus on the other sex, males.

00:04:00.439 --> 00:04:05.569
Males developed a greater aptitude for physical
strength and the natural courage to hunt to

00:04:05.569 --> 00:04:08.290
provide food for their tribe and women.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:14.700
Men evolved to have aggressiveness, resilience
and assertiveness, underpinned by undying

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:21.239
competitiveness so they could compete against
rival males and protect their tribe from other

00:04:21.239 --> 00:04:25.639
scarier tribes who had larger, pointier sticks.

00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:32.539
Sure those traits were essential pre-civilisation,
but why can’t we get rid of them today through

00:04:32.539 --> 00:04:35.270
the systematic emasculation of men?

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:38.050
Are they not redundant in the 21st century?

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:45.220
Don’t such traits cause nothing but toxicity
and evil throughout our societies?

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:52.520
These are the edicts that many social justice
warriors seek to mandate on modern men.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:58.639
Masculinity is a shifting social construct,
its nature has mutated over the generations.

00:04:58.639 --> 00:05:04.919
Today it is more socially acceptable than
ever before in the history of humanity for

00:05:04.919 --> 00:05:11.480
a man to show emotion and share his feeling
with his friends, for a man to cry, for a

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:16.210
man to choose another man as a sexual partner
and marry him.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:23.870
All these are truly amazing and undeniably
positive advances towards a better, more harmonic

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:28.550
world and none of these things degrades a
man’s masculinity.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:36.350
But these are not the traits that authoritarian
leftist activists are trying to suppress.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:43.410
What is under fire is the more assertive,
domineering and tough side that is biologically

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:47.430
present in every man, to varying degrees.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:54.120
Such traits and the actions which can be associated
with them are too often referred to as toxic

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.120
masculinity.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:01.720
The issue here is that so-called “toxic
behaviour” is not endemic to masculine men

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.110
or even men.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:08.810
Evil and malice are present across all demographic
cross-sections of society.

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:13.220
There’s no denying that men commit crime
and nobody would claim that either sex is

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.640
perfect.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:23.330
But before shunning masculinity it’s imperative
that we understand how dangerous this can

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:28.099
be, for one simple reason.

00:06:28.099 --> 00:06:35.990
Masculinity does more good than bad, for everyone,
men and women.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.229
And not just a little bit more good.

00:06:39.229 --> 00:06:45.889
For every bad deed a man commits in the world
I would propose that well over a thousand

00:06:45.889 --> 00:06:51.590
good deeds are carried out by other masculine
men, every day.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:55.530
Only a fool would argue that men never do
bad.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:07:00.949
In 2014 73% of those arrested in the US were
male.

00:07:00.949 --> 00:07:07.470
But to live in a society where the majority
of good men are publically shamed for the

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:14.860
crimes of the minority of bad men is damaging
to the mental health and sense of purpose

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.510
of men the world over.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:23.129
Especially when the underlying and natural
biological traits of the male species are

00:07:23.129 --> 00:07:26.490
being labelled as the cause of all these evils.

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:31.540
It also pulls all the attention away from
the many beautiful things that most masculine

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:39.060
men achieve every day, which vastly outnumber
the horrendous things a much smaller portion

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.010
of masculine men do.

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:46.539
Do not forget that masculinity was born from
a natural desire for men to provide for and

00:07:46.539 --> 00:07:48.250
protect their family.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:53.909
When a man takes his daughter to school, gives
her a kiss and wishes her a good day, that

00:07:53.909 --> 00:07:56.840
is masculinity doing good.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:03.710
When a man works over ten hours a day to feed,
cloth and shelter his family, that is masculinity

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.130
doing good.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:11.190
When a firefighter rescues a child from a
burning building, that is masculinity doing

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.379
good.

00:08:12.379 --> 00:08:20.349
When a policeman arrests a perpetrator of
domestic abuse, rape or murder, that is masculinity

00:08:20.349 --> 00:08:21.889
doing good.

00:08:21.889 --> 00:08:27.939
When a young man shields his sweetheart with
his jacket when it rains, that is masculinity

00:08:27.939 --> 00:08:29.560
doing good.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:36.080
When a surgeon saves a person’s life through
open heart surgery, that is masculinity doing

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.150
good.

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:42.440
When Alexander Fleming invented penicillin,
saving millions of lives, that was masculinity

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.140
doing good.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:49.560
When millions of brave men gave their lives
to prevent fascism and tyranny from engulfing

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:57.320
our world in 1914 and 1939, that was masculinity
doing good.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:02.400
The truth is, trying to control the tiny minority
of bad men by quashing masculinity in all

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:07.250
men is an exercise in futility and idiocy.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:12.160
Bad men will not stop being bad because they
become less masculine, they will only become

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:18.550
more frustrated and frustrated people are
more likely to commit injustices than content

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.550
people.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:25.710
The result will be fewer good masculine men
to stop the bad men and bad women from being

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.410
bad.

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:33.770
Masculinity and femininity are the two pillars
that underpin a cohesive, progressive and

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:38.450
productive society that is beneficial to all.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:45.260
Shorten or remove either one of those pillars
and society as we know, the society that we’ve

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:49.370
built over thousands of years and the society
that we’ve protected against tyranny and

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:53.550
evil will come crashing down beneath our very
feet.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:10:00.160
Yet how does modern society thank these everyday
incredible men?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:08.690
They are widely vilified, on social media,
in the press, in schools and in popular culture,

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:14.700
and now even in advertisements, the historic
bastion of greedy capitalism.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:19.620
This has resulted in men committing suicide
at three times the rate of women.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:24.860
And these men who help build and improve our
society every day face other challenges at

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:26.860
an alarming ratio.

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:31.410
Men are twice as likely to be the victim of
a violent assault or robbery.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:34.350
3.5 times more likely to be murdered.

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:42.280
96% of workplace fatalities happen to men
Men are 5.6 times as likely as women to be

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.280
incarcerated.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:49.380
86% of the homeless population is male Boys
have been lagging behind girls in educational

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:54.970
achievement since 1991, and the gap is widening
every year.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:11:02.200
This points to a far more concerning fact,
that the increasing shaming of masculinity

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:07.770
in schools is causing a crisis in the development
of young men.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:13.590
Competitive games that are deemed too aggressive
such as British bulldog or tag and dodgeball

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:18.000
have been long since banned in many school
playgrounds in the West.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:23.910
A few schools in Britain are even considering
banning the sport of rugby, a fundamental

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.290
part of masculine development in young boys
since 1823.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:39.920
Whilst these games and sports can on rare
occasions cause injuries, they play a vital

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:45.630
role in developing character and a strong,
competitive attitude in young boys that will

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:51.620
enable them to, later in life, compete in
the workplace and protect their family.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:57.700
In fact, competitiveness, which is predominantly
a masculine trait, has been mostly eradicated

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:59.590
from our schools in the West.

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:04.790
During sports day and other events, everyone
is given a participation award, there is no

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.050
winner or loser.

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:12.420
I failed miserably at sports, I finished last
on sports day and I wasn’t given a trophy

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:16.990
for taking part, I got nothing, and you know
what it taught me?

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:24.200
That next time I need to try harder, that
I would never amount to anything unless I

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:32.750
put the effort in and practised, not just
in sports, but in every aspect of life.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:37.690
That was one of the most important lessons
I have ever learnt.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:43.940
In the same way, that over-sanitisation during
youth leads to a weak immune system, mollycoddling

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:53.120
children is not how strong societies are built,
doing so is in reality, a threat to a strong

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.050
society for the next generation.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:13:00.820
Nowhere is misandry more rife than in Swedish
schools.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:06.550
Several pre-schools and primary schools in
Sweden have gone to extensive efforts to remove

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:11.620
