00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:21.560
A legal amendment in 1998 legally mandated
all schools in Sweden to actively work against

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.990
gender stereotypes.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:32.170
This all sounds very utopian in theory, but
in practice, it is nothing short of brainwashing,

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:39.640
that leads to a difficult and confusing progression
into teenhood and adulthood for these children.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:45.250
They are being taught to ignore basic science,
go against the natural biological pull of

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.060
their own body.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:52.590
This will only achieve to create a generation
of frustrated, passive men.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:57.590
Without being free to indulge in their masculinity
in the playground and at home then these boys

00:13:57.590 --> 00:14:03.280
will grow into men who are unable to compete
in the workplace and in personal matters,

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.680
unable to defend themselves and their family.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:13.081
If evidence of this brainwashing were needed
then look no further than Seafarer’s Preschool

00:14:13.081 --> 00:14:14.730
in Sweden.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:22.120
Where boys and girls as young as one are actually
segregated so their natural gender roles can

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.260
