00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:30.050
Boys are made to play with toy kitchens and
give each other massages.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.960
Girls are forced to practice shouting “No!”.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:38.260
A so-called “gender specialist” is employed
by the preschool to pick up on and coerce

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:43.410
boys who refuse to partake in feminine activities
such as dance.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:48.890
Boys are encouraged to wear dresses and the
teachers celebrated when one particular girl

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:54.950
who used to be “very girlie” according
to her mother, was reared by the preschool

00:14:54.950 --> 00:15:01.080
to become more boisterous and her parents
noted that she had become more “cheeky and

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.130
