00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:18.510
The boys shouted and hit more.

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:23.970
The staff at the preschool says this is not
okay.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:29.900
Well golly, it’s almost as if their biology
compels them to adhere to their natural gender

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:36.511
roles and that forcibly preventing them from
embracing this is actually child abuse, just

00:15:36.511 --> 00:15:37.930
a thought.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:43.130
An inability to protect his family is not
the only issue an emasculated man will face

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.760
in adulthood.

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:52.060
What is just as crucial, is a man’s ability
to lead and inspire his family, particularly

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.560
his children.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:58.320
When a masculine presence is stripped away
from an otherwise nuclear family unit the

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:02.600
consequences can often be disastrous.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:07.500
There is no rule that children can't thrive
in non-nuclear families, different family

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:11.580
setups can absolutely nurture incredible children.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:17.250
But looking solely at fatherlessness the statistics
show a clear trend.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:21.980
Children who grow up without a father figure
are twice as likely to drop out of school,

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:27.060
twice as likely to become obese and four times
as likely to succumb to poverty.

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:34.161
They are also more likely to commit crime,
go to prison, abuse drugs and alcohol.

00:16:34.161 --> 00:16:39.610
Fatherless girls are seven times more likely
to fall pregnant as a teen.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:43.620
After all this rhetoric there’s an important
distinction that must be made.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:49.230
I, myself and I sincerely hope many other
men out there have no desire to strip men

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:53.310
of their right to choose how they want to
develop through life.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:58.430
If men want to go against their natural masculinity
or even seek to abolish it, then we should

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:04.640
all work to protect their rights to do so
and me, I say more power to you.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:11.449
But it’s so very important that men have
that right to choose.

00:17:11.449 --> 00:17:17.420
Just like freedom of speech, it’s essential
that as a society we work to protect a man

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:23.079
or a woman’s right to live how they want
to live, be who they want to be, walk how

00:17:23.079 --> 00:17:27.959
they want to, talk how they want to and wear
whatever they damn well desire.

00:17:27.959 --> 00:17:33.390
But when it comes to a man’s right to fully
embrace and assert his masculinity in a positive

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:40.309
way it’s labelled as “sexist male privilege”
by the media and the tribal activists on the

00:17:40.309 --> 00:17:42.759
internet.

00:17:42.759 --> 00:17:48.919
In doing so, a man’s right to choose to
embrace masculinity is being eroded more and

00:17:48.919 --> 00:17:51.019
more so every year.

00:17:51.019 --> 00:17:56.830
That’s why it's vital that when companies
such as Gillette seek to tar all men with

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:03.460
the same discriminatory brush and suppress
our right to embrace our biology, that we

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:09.600
fight to retain our rights to be whoever the
hell we want to be.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.710
Masculinity should be empowered, not shamed
and belittled.

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:20.870
Men everywhere must continue to show the world
that overall, masculinity is a force for good,

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:22.570
not evil.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:27.799
Never be ashamed of your masculinity my hairy
friends because it built the roads beneath

00:18:27.799 --> 00:18:30.339
your feet.

